---
import PolicyPage from '../components/site/PolicyPage.astro';
import { SITE, textHref, guaranteeName } from '../site.config.js';
// The money-back guarantee. Don't call it the manufacturer's until Laser Health Technologies confirms
// it covers our sales. Its length comes from SITE.guaranteeDays in site.config.js; while that is null, no number of days is shown.
const days = SITE.guaranteeDays;
---
<PolicyPage
  title="Returns and money-back guarantee"
  description={`How the ${guaranteeName} works for LaserTouchOne bought from Laser Micro Duo, and how to return your device.`}
  lead={`Every LaserTouchOne kit comes with a ${guaranteeName}. Here’s how it works and how to send your device back.`}
  updated="November 17, 2026"
>
  <h2>The money-back guarantee</h2>
  <p>
    If LaserTouchOne isn’t right for you, send it back for a refund of the device price. You cover return
    shipping. We handle the return and refund for you.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>How long you have:</strong> {days ? `${days} days from the day your order is delivered.` : 'contact us to confirm the guarantee period for your order before you send anything back.'}</li>
    <li><strong>What you get back:</strong> a full refund of the device price, to your original payment method.</li>
    <li><strong>Return shipping:</strong> you cover return shipping.</li>
    <li><strong>Original shipping:</strong> the shipping you paid on your order is not refunded.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How to return your device</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact us first.</strong>
      {SITE.textNumber ? <>Text <a href={textHref}>{SITE.textNumber}</a> or email </> : <>Email </>}
      <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a> with your order number{days ? `, within ${days} days of delivery` : ''}.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Get your return instructions.</strong> We’ll reply with the return address and anything you need to include. Please don’t send a package before you hear from us.</li>
    <li><strong>Pack the whole kit.</strong> Send back the device and everything that came with it: the zippered travel case, charger, gel, user manual and warranty card.</li>
    <li><strong>Ship it.</strong> Use a carrier with tracking, and keep your receipt. The return shipping cost is yours.</li>
    <li><strong>Get your refund.</strong> Once the return arrives and is checked, we refund the device price to your original payment method and confirm by email.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Warranty</h2>
  <p>
    Your LaserTouchOne also comes with the warranty from {SITE.manufacturer}. If something goes wrong with
    your device, contact us and we’ll help you with the claim.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>{SITE.replyHours} If anything here isn’t clear, ask us before you buy.</p>
</PolicyPage>
